# points-moved-linger (h8-points-row): frames at 0, 300, 599 and 700 ms
# after the k-drag's release: the badge until 600 ms, gone after.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 331.5 485.5
down
move 356.5 485.5 over 80
up
shot points-moved-linger-0000
wait 300
shot points-moved-linger-0300
wait 299
shot points-moved-linger-0599
wait 101
shot points-moved-linger-0700
wait 1200
